# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Venture Co. Mine

step The Venture Co. Mine
  tip The goblins work the mine in the hills north-east of the well. Supervisor Fizsprocket stands in the back of the mine; his Mulgore Expansion Plans start Fizsprocket's Notes, and the other pages lie inside the mine.
  goto 64.9,43.3 "The Venture Co. Mine"
  complete 764
  complete 765
  collect 281031
  accept 98424
  complete 98424

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Northern Mulgore

step Wildmane Water Well
  tip Cross north-west past Thunder Bluff to the Wildmane Water Well in the far north of Mulgore.
  use 5416 quest 760.1 @42.8,14.2     -- Wildmane Cleansing Totem

step Dangers of the Windfury
  tip The Windfury harpies hold Windfury Ridge, north and west of the well.
  complete 743

step Seer Wiserunner
  tip Seer Wiserunner stands at the edge of the Bael'dun Digsite, south of the well.
  turnin 772
  accept 773

step Dwarven Digging
  tip The dwarves of the Bael'dun Digsite carry the Prospector's Picks. Smash them at the forge in Bloodhoof Village.
  complete 746

step Sharing the Land
  tip The Palemane gnolls hold Palemane Rock, south of the digsite and west of Bloodhoof. Perith Stormhoof is held in their camp: lead him out.
  complete 745
  accept 98430
  complete 98430

