# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Bluff

step Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Ride a lift up to the mesas. Tal keeps the wind riders on the central rise; Cairne stands in the great tent there.
  getfp "Thunder Bluff" npc 2995      -- Tal
  turnin 775
  turnin 99082
  turnin 98430
