  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Eylah Sunhorn wants tauren incense: buy its four parts from Nida the herbalist, Nata the enchanting supplier, Mahu the leatherworking supplier and Naal the cooking supplier, then combine them into Prepared Incense.
