# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Crossroads

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip Leave Mulgore by the south-eastern pass and follow the road to the Crossroads. Sergra Darkthorn stands by the inn, Tonga Runetotem at the south gate. The Barrens guide starts here.
  getfp "Crossroads" npc 3615         -- Devrak
  sethome "The Crossroads" npc 3934   -- Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind
  turnin 860                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  turnin 886                          -- Tonga Runetotem

